				<wikidot:authorName>TL333s</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1304786</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Scantron remembers numbers better than I do.</p> <blockquote> <p>For god's sake Jillian, stop redacting my notes no</p> </blockquote> <p>This was the line that made me think of Researchers James and Abigail. The whole article comes off as very sitcommy, steeped in negative marriage culture. I don't know what you actually call it, but the whole idea of &quot;We got married and now we just fight all the time because that's what people expect from marriage&quot;.</p> <p>Maybe I'm reading too much into this, but while that's obviously not what you've experienced, it seems to be what you've written into the article, and I did not find it funny.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
