				<wikidot:authorName>DrMagnus</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>318209</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I disagree with your point pretty strongly. The joke is people arguing over losing the remote.</p> <p>While I can see why you'd think the joke is two people arguing over a comparative object, I think you missed the relatability angle. This is based on an actual joke my GF and I have, about the remote being in a quantum state.</p> <p>I'm not actually aware of the -J you're talking about, however.</p> <p>That being said, if you didnt like it, fair enough, but there's not a &quot;one joke per conceptual genre&quot; rule.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
