				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2290957#post-2830203</guid>
				<title>Author Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2290957/scp-027-j#post-2830203</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 23 May 2017 15:48:51 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>DrMagnus</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>318209</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>So this one was inspired by an idea my GF had: That we never have the Roku and Cable Box remotes together, so they're obviously quantum states of a single remote.</p> <p>From there, I just played up jokes we use on each other.</p> <p>Hopefully you guys get a chuckle. &lt;3</p> <p>Special thanks to Lex1nat0r, InitHello, ChaoSera, Rimple, Orionbasher, and Lily for crit, and feedback.</p> <p>Edit: Darkened the blue a bit, 'cause yowza.</p> <p>EDIT2: Both images are <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">hosted on the sandbox till I can fix it a little more intelligently, and are both</span> pulled from Wikipedia and are CC compliant.</p> <p>Edit3: <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">I'm aware the formatting is wonky on the image. I'll fix it as soon as I get home, and have access to a webserver.</span> <sub>i feex</sub></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
